["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"119. Kimi Linear、Minimax M2？和楊松琳考古算法變種史，並預演未來架構改進方案 Linear Attention KDA Delta Rule Sparse Attention Sliding Window Attention Scaling Ladder\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-11-03-zhangxiaojun-纯线性注意力不-work-3-比-1-混合才是共识/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8af4f82306c1b043-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1103</span></div>\n<h2>純線性注意力不 work，3 比 1 混合才是共識</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">純 Linear Attention 有根本缺陷，下限無保證；Kimi、千問都收斂到每 3 層線性插 1 層全局注意力，而 MiniMax 從 M1 退回 Full Attention 是因為評測漏了多跳推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線性注意力</span><span class=\"tag\">模型架構</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"118. 對李想的第二次3小時訪談：CEO大模型、MoE、梁文鋒、VLA、能量、記憶、對抗人性、親密關係、人類的智慧 VLA MoE AgentOS RLHF 世界模型\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-30-zhangxiaojun-李想-通用-agent-五年内不会出现-只会先有-agentos/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a2c96d240eb08aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>李想：通用 agent 五年內不會出現，只會先有 agentOS</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李想判斷通用 agent 五年內不會出現，真正會出現的是 agentOS——各專業在上面開發自己的專業 agent。因為生產工具必須能行動、能替代專業工作，而不是給個建議。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"賈樟柯×羅永浩！成為賈樟柯（上）\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-29-cn2d7912-一次被放鸽子的下午-一场电影决定了贾樟柯要去拍电影/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9972a3ea5b348a4e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:45:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1029</span></div>\n<h2>一次被放鴿子的下午，一場電影決定了賈樟柯要去拍電影</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一次赴約被放鴿子後，賈樟柯在電影院偶然看到《黃土地》,發現自己最熟悉卻視而不見的家鄉生活原來可以被電影這樣講述，當場決定要去拍電影。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">賈樟柯</span><span class=\"tag\">導演成長</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"117. 開源一段論文探索之旅：模型範式、Infra和數據、語言、多模態的完整變遷史 MFU MOE COT LoRA RLHF 光流\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-28-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-第一阶段的赢家不是最后的赢家/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a079c1aa86947eb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">4:22:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠：第一階段的贏家不是最後的贏家</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商業史上第一波跑出來的公司幾乎從不是下個階段的贏家。模型公司是提煉基礎油的煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">論文精讀</span><span class=\"tag\">模型範式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"名創優品葉國富×羅永浩！重塑線下購物，讓人們重新愛上逛街！ SKU fine dining\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-22-cn2d7912-名创优品老板-超市只分两种-卖产品的活-卖货架的死/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c387de8b2a7bb5e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:54:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>名創優品老闆：超市只分兩種，賣產品的活，賣貨架的死</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">葉國富說，山姆和胖東來靠做好產品活下來，其他超市靠進場費、上架費賺錢，這套邏輯正是他收購永輝、複製胖東來模式的全部依據。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線下零售</span><span class=\"tag\">IP運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"宋方金×羅永浩！故事必須有人講下去 science fiction\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-17-cn2d7912-编剧不该怕机器人像人-该怕人越来越像机器人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d1f8cd96251a093-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">5:22:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1017</span></div>\n<h2>編劇不該怕機器人像人，該怕人越來越像機器人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宋方金說現在的AI寫故事大綱已經超過六成編劇，真正的危機不是技術取代創作，而是創作者早已把自己寫成套路機器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">影視行業</span><span class=\"tag\">編劇生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"影視颶風TIM×羅永浩！用影像打開世界的夢想家 OKR ENTP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-10-cn2d7912-做内容赚不到规模化的钱-靠卖t恤一年卖出上百万件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8526f00042d68a45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:51:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>做內容賺不到規模化的錢，靠賣T恤一年賣出上百萬件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">影視颶風內容本身沒有規模效應，一期視頻賺一期的錢；真正能複製、能賣出幾十萬到上百萬件的是T恤和衝鋒衣，這才是支撐公司的生意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自媒體變現</span><span class=\"tag\">內容規模化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"116. 吳明輝口述19年史：漫長的沉浮、痛苦急轉、企業級Agentic Model、現實世界的數值遊戲、IPO agentic model pass@1 MOA context\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-10-09-zhangxiaojun-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb4fc975caeda4bd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:47:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>模型是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">基礎模型只要有兩家以上就不可能賺錢，會像電價一樣被捲成電費；真正的壁壘是別人沒存下來的 context 數據，以及大廠因為晉升機制永遠做不了的最後一公里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業級AI</span><span class=\"tag\">數據壁壘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"周鴻禕×羅永浩！周鴻禕深度談 AI！近四小時高密度輸出 AGI PMF MCP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-24-cn2d7912-ai没法像互联网一样免费-因为token成本只增不减/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/244c36d13df4d6ea-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:32:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI沒法像互聯網一樣免費，因為token成本只增不減</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做一個10分鐘視頻要燒掉約1000萬token、花10到20塊錢——周鴻禕認為任務越複雜AI的邊際成本越高，靠廣告或免費換規模的老路走不通，收費是遲早的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI商業模式</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"115. 對OpenAI姚順雨3小時訪談：6年Agent研究、人與系統、吞噬的邊界、既單極又多元的世界 pass@k pass^k affordance memory hierarchy intrinsic reward\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-11-zhangxiaojun-ai-下半场-通用方法已经有了-难的是找任务/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfbf7de74c2135f3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>AI 下半場：通用方法已經有了，難的是找任務</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">姚順雨說 AI 主線已從「造武器」進入「選戰場」——方法終於通用了，但真正的瓶頸不是推理能力，而是模型拿不到人腦子裡的 context。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"五條人之仁科×羅永浩！近五個小時的變態超長對談！ X先生 時光列車 迪倫精神\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-10-cn2d7912-土味美学不是设计出来的-而是贫穷生活里自然长出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/78ad6d4d665acca7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">4:37:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0910</span></div>\n<h2>土味美學不是設計出來的，而是貧窮生活裡自然長出來的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說這套土味美學不是提前設計的風格策略，而是像希臘神廟的柱子褪色一樣，被貧窮歲月自然磨出來的真實。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">獨立音樂</span><span class=\"tag\">鄉土美學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"114. 與殷一、歐迪聊聊薩洛蒙：中國意外的增長閥門、小眾越野跑與少女故事 the winning moments OOTD repeat traffic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-06-zhangxiaojun-越野跑核心人群十年没变-萨洛蒙靠女性破了圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2776969c0511e305-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0906</span></div>\n<h2>越野跑核心人群十年沒變，薩洛蒙靠女性破了圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國越野跑核心人群十年前十萬人，今年還是十萬人，區別是老了十歲。薩洛蒙沒丟專業線，靠女性拉新把會員從十萬做到八百萬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">戶外運動</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何廣智×羅永浩！何廣智：我到長安了 callback cue\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-09-01-cn2d7912-何广智-做好人比做坏人容易-因为伪装太难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c82a199f8115741a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:17:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0901</span></div>\n<h2>何廣智：做好人比做壞人容易，因為偽裝太難</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何廣智說：選擇當好人不是天性，是算準了做好事幾乎必有回報，而當壞人必須八面玲瓏、不能露一絲破綻，門檻太高、太難偽裝了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">脫口秀</span><span class=\"tag\">創作方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"113. 和楊植麟時隔1年的對話：K2、Agentic LLM、缸中之腦和“站在無限的開端” Muon optimizer test time scaling brain in a vat reward hacking curriculum learning\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-27-zhangxiaojun-管公司像训模型-sft-太多-团队就没有创造力了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b659eec041fc4bbc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>管公司像訓模型：SFT 太多，團隊就沒有創造力了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tim 天天跟楊植麟講：管理要用 RL 的方式，不是 SFT。SFT 是直接告訴人該怎麼做，太多，人就沒有主觀能動性；RL 只給獎勵，但獎勵定義不好，全隊都會去 hack 它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"何小鵬×羅永浩！何小鵬講述從財富自由奔赴無盡地獄模式的創業故事 soul side Tops\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-26-cn2d7912-何小鹏-造车十年-没有一家中国车企真正拿到船票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f6e10cb84ed08b87-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">2:47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：造車十年，沒有一家中國車企真正拿到船票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">何小鵬說中國新能源車的淘汰賽大概五年內見分曉，最後大概留下五家，但眼下每一家、包括小鵬自己，都還沒拿到那張船票。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">造車新勢力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI研發投入</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"李想×羅永浩！四小時馬拉松訪談！李想首度公開講述 25 年創業之路 GTD PHEV e-power\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-19-cn2d7912-李想-顶级企业家共同点不是选得准-而是反人性高频迭代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9a33a06a8261b5e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"羅\"><span class=\"dur\">3:56:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">羅永浩的十字路口</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0819</span></div>\n<h2>李想：頂級企業家共同點不是選得準，而是反人性高頻迭代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他說頂級企業家選對賽道、能長期堅持只是入場門檻，真正拉開差距的是黃仁勳、字節、美團那種反人性的高頻市場迭代速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業方法論</span><span class=\"tag\">組織設計</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"112. 和廣密聊大模型季報：分化與收斂、全家桶與垂直整合、L4體驗與挖礦窗口 Reward Hacking L4 體驗 全家桶 垂直整合 DPI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-18-zhangxiaojun-模型公司是挖矿的-产品公司是炼矿的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dba5cdc7209fbd97-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0818</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司是挖礦的，產品公司是煉礦的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">最好的模型拿走了最大的流量和收入，但挖礦的窗口正在縮短：從兩年到九個月再到三四個月。基礎模型公司開始端到端做 Agent，應用公司的成本劣勢是結構性的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"111. 李一帆口述激光雷達11年創業史：你仔細想行業的機會來自哪？是國家、民族的機會 ASIC ITC POC Robotaxi Tier 1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-08-07-zhangxiaojun-激光雷达降价-99-5-靠的不是上量而是设计/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a07079c1963cee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:08:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>激光雷達降價 99.5%，靠的不是上量而是設計</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">硬件的降本不來自規模，來自設計能力：把幾十萬一臺的激光雷達做進芯片，才可能從功能件變成安全件，最後變成標配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">激光雷達</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"110. 逐段講解Kimi K2報告並對照ChatGPT Agent、Qwen3-Coder等：“系統工程的力量” MCP KV Cache verifiable reward reward hacking persona partial rollout\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-07-30-zhangxiaojun-kimi-k2-把配方全公开了-但复现它仍是手艺活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4a70954860f9ed-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>Kimi K2 把配方全公開了，但復現它仍是手藝活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K2 報告把數據合成、可驗證獎勵、RL 基礎設施的 recipe 全寫出來了，但每個 prompt、每個參數都要調穩，本質是系統工程而非 idea。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">Kimi K2</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"109. 機器人遭遇數據荒？與謝晨聊：仿真與合成數據、Meta天價收購和Alexandr Wang Sim2Real Real2Sim data pyramid cross embodiment acquihire scaling law moment\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-07-15-zhangxiaojun-仿真不等于仿真器-机器人数据荒里最赚钱的是原料商/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/17864fa8278d8825-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0715</span></div>\n<h2>仿真不等於仿真器：機器人數據荒裡最賺錢的是原料商</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">具身智能還在 GPT-1 階段，沒找到 scaling law 的配方。真正卡住行業的是高質量物理資產和場景，而不是仿真器——所以做仿真器的人反而最不賺錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">合成數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"108. 余凱口述30年史：世界不止刀光劍影，是一部人來人往的江湖故事 PMF Cuda Baseband HMI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-07-07-zhangxiaojun-科学家创业最大的-bug-不知道客户是谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b30b49056fd22ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:57:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0707</span></div>\n<h2>科學家創業最大的 bug：不知道客戶是誰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">地平線前五年在空調、玩具、家電、汽車之間 360 度掃射，2019 年砍掉一半人、歐印汽車，才從亂打亂撞變成戰略驅動的公司。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創業</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"107. 和夢秋的catch-up：創投挺無聊，也聊聊旅行讀書和女性主義 sim2real general purpose agent reductive\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-29-zhangxiaojun-ai-应用没找到场景-deepseek-也没繁荣创业生态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c74c419a6b9140d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0629</span></div>\n<h2>AI 應用沒找到場景，DeepSeek 也沒繁榮創業生態</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">清流資本王夢秋的判斷：資本寒冬沒過去，DeepSeek 抹平了信息差卻沒造出新場景，通用 Agent 可能是偽命題，真正剛需的是垂直工作流。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"106. 和王鶴聊，具身智能的學術邊緣史和資本轟炸後的人為亂象 sim2real VLA perception action loop object goal navigation six dof pose\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-22-zhangxiaojun-机器人公司最大的敌人不是技术-是摇操和讲故事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d36c7ae97ae40ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0622</span></div>\n<h2>機器人公司最大的敵人不是技術，是搖操和講故事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王鶴說這一代具身智能公司只有兩條死路：長期漂著講故事，或者每個場景從頭重做。他押注合成數據，真實數據只佔訓練量的1%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"105. 和奔馳王忻聊，產業大轉折下的德國汽車、話語權和技術battle Tier 1 QNX Rule-based 端到端 SOA V2X\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2025-06-19-zhangxiaojun-奔驰中国团队用数据跟德国总部抢话语权/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41a98711cc822d74-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0619</span></div>\n<h2>奔馳中國團隊用數據跟德國總部搶話語權</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tier 1 黑盒交付的時代結束了，主機廠要自己 operate 數據。中國團隊不是把話語權奪過來的，是承諾、交付、建立信任換來的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">智能駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>"]